{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform your VR experience with this innovative SteamVR plugin that creates a virtual treadmill system for natural locomotion. Instead of relying on traditional joystick controls, this plugin reads real-time motion data from your physical controllers and body trackers to translate your natural in-place movements into virtual movement within VR games. Simply move your arms and feet in place as if you're walking or running, and the plugin intelligently maps these gestures to standard joystick and trackpad inputs that VR games can understand. This customizable solution supports head, hand, and foot tracking, allowing you to configure sensitivity, movement styles, and button mappings to match your preferred locomotion method. Compatible with existing VR games that support standard input methods, this plugin provides a smoother, more immersive, and physically engaging way to explore virtual worlds.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3992320?t=1760933861","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3992320?t=1760933861","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992320/33b36aff163ef5777189d290c6d5b1bf95819cdc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760933861","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992320/33b36aff163ef5777189d290c6d5b1bf95819cdc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760933861","categories":[{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform your VR experience with this innovative SteamVR plugin that creates a virtual treadmill system for natural locomotion. Instead of relying on traditional joystick controls, this plugin reads real-time motion data from your physical controllers and body trackers to translate your natural in-place movements into virtual movement within VR games. Simply move your arms and feet in place as if you're walking or running, and the plugin intelligently maps these gestures to standard joystick and trackpad inputs that VR games can understand. This customizable solution supports head, hand, and foot tracking, allowing you to configure sensitivity, movement styles, and button mappings to match your preferred locomotion method. Compatible with existing VR games that support standard input methods, this plugin provides a smoother, more immersive, and physically engaging way to explore virtual worlds.</p>","developers":["https://github.com/phjong"],"genres":[{"description":"Utilities","id":"57"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992320/4bffaadc7d7eaf78e0c67ed2f879d11744870f91/header.jpg?t=1760933861","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3992320/96592921/722c04db171357fa8e760324069b9144cabd20bb/1757106463/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757543626","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3992320/96592921/722c04db171357fa8e760324069b9144cabd20bb/1757106463/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757543626","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3992320/96592921/722c04db171357fa8e760324069b9144cabd20bb/1757106463/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1757543626","id":257193819,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257193819/movie480.mp4?t=1757543626","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257193819/movie_max.mp4?t=1757543626"},"name":"WanderFlow example usage in VRChat","thumbnail":"https://share